1. The systemd unit file
Create /etc/systemd/system/sunlamp.service:

[Unit]
Description=Sunrise/Sunset Lamp Controller
After=network.target

[Service]
Type=idle
User=pi
WorkingDirectory=/home/pi/sunlamp
ExecStart=/usr/bin/python3 /home/pi/sunlamp/sunlamp.py
Restart=always
RestartSec=5

[Install]
WantedBy=multi-user.target

Then:

sudo systemctl daemon-reload
sudo systemctl enable sunlamp.service
sudo systemctl start sunlamp.service

Useful commands:

Command	Purpose
sudo systemctl status sunlamp	Check if running
sudo journalctl -f -u sunlamp	Live logs
sudo systemctl restart sunlamp	Restart after edits
sudo systemctl stop sunlamp	Stop
